  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-reserva-6-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla el punto simétrico de \\(P(1,1,1)\\) respecto de la recta \\(r\\) de ecuación \\(\\dfrac{x-1}2=\\dfrac y3=\\dfrac{z+1}{-1}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\((1,0,-1)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(2,3,-1)\\): \\(r\\equiv(1+2t,\\,3t,\\,-1-t)\\).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(2,\\ 3,\\ -1)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv 2x+3y-z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(P(1,\\ 1,\\ 1)\\): \\(2\\cdot1+3\\cdot1-1+D=0\\iff D=-4\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv 2x+3y-z-4=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[2(1+2t)+3(3t)-(-1-t)-4=0\\iff 14t-1=0\\iff t=\\frac{1}{14}\\]\\[M\\left(\\frac{8}{7},\\ \\frac{3}{14},\\ -\\frac{15}{14}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{1+a}2=\\frac{8}{7},\\qquad\\frac{1+b}2=\\frac{3}{14},\\qquad\\frac{1+c}2=-\\frac{15}{14}\\]\\[a=\\frac{9}{7},\\qquad b=-\\frac{4}{7},\\qquad c=-\\frac{22}{7}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":8,\"el\":27,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[0.316,1.777,1.964],[2.903,0.052,1.964],[1.97,-1.349,-4.106],[-0.618,0.376,-4.106]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.97,-1.349,-4.106],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1.303,0.455,-1.152],[1.284,0.561,-0.872],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.284,0.561,-0.872],[1.124,0.32,-0.792],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.054,-1.582,-0.473],[2.34,2.01,-1.67],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.34,2.01,-1.67],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1.464,0.695,-1.232],[2.052,1.577,-1.526],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[1.181,0.002,-1.631],[1.769,0.884,-1.925],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[1.0,1.0,1.0],[1.286,-0.571,-3.143],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[1.0,1.0,1.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.143,0.214,-1.071],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[1.286,-0.571,-3.143],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m10r6a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m10r6a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m10r6a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m10r6a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='153.3,18.0 74.1,58.4 26.0,246.0 105.2,205.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='97.9' y1='138.1' x2='102.1' y2='128.5' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='102.1' y1='128.5' x2='93.8' y2='122.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='27.9' y1='86.6' x2='151.4' y2='177.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='157.4' y='177.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='106.2' y1='144.2' x2='136.5' y2='166.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m10r6a4d)'/><text x='140.5' y='162.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='81.4' y1='151.3' x2='111.7' y2='173.5' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m10r6a4n)'/><text x='117.7' y='183.5' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='120.2' y1='60.8' x2='59.1' y2='203.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='120.2' cy='60.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='127.2' y='54.8' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='89.7' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='97.7' y='144.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='59.1' cy='203.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='66.1' y='197.2' font-weight='700'>P′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='21.8' y2='277.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='18.0' y='283.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.8' y2='271.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.4' y='275.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(P'\\left(\\frac{9}{7},\\ -\\frac{4}{7},\\ -\\frac{22}{7}\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}=\\left(\\frac{1}{7},\\ -\\frac{11}{14},\\ -\\frac{29}{14}\\right)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(2\\cdot\\frac{1}{7}+3\\cdot(-\\frac{11}{14})-(-\\frac{29}{14})=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
