  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-reserva-6-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}e^{-x}&\\text{si }x\\le0\\\\1-x^2&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\lt1\\\\\\dfrac2{x+1}&\\text{si }1\\le x\\end{cases}\\) Estudia su continuidad y derivabilidad. Determina la función derivada de \\(f\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cada trozo es continuo y derivable en su intervalo abierto (\\(x+1\\neq0\\) si \\(x\\ge1\\)). Estudio \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=1\\).</p><p><b>En </b>\\(x=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(f(0)=e^0=1\\) y \\(\\lim_{x\\to0^+}(1-x^2)=1\\): <b>continua</b>. Derivadas laterales: \\(f'(0^-)=-e^{0}=-1\\) y \\(f'(0^+)=-2\\cdot0=0\\): distintas, <b>no derivable</b><i class='n' data-t='th'>Para ser derivable en un punto, las derivadas laterales tienen que coincidir.</i>.</p><p><b>En </b>\\(x=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\lim_{x\\to1^-}(1-x^2)=0\\) y \\(f(1)=\\frac22=1\\): <b>no es continua</b> (salto), y por tanto tampoco derivable<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si una función no es continua en un punto, no puede ser derivable en él.</i>.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='85.0,28.1 86.2,30.8 87.5,33.5 88.7,36.0 90.0,38.6 91.2,41.0 92.4,43.4 93.7,45.7 94.9,48.0 96.1,50.1 97.4,52.3 98.6,54.4 99.9,56.4 101.1,58.4 102.3,60.3 103.6,62.2 104.8,64.0 106.0,65.8 107.3,67.5 108.5,69.2 109.8,70.8 111.0,72.4 112.2,74.0 113.5,75.5 114.7,76.9 116.0,78.4 117.2,79.8 118.4,81.1 119.7,82.5 120.9,83.7 122.1,85.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='122.1,85.0 123.7,85.1 125.2,85.2 126.8,85.5 128.3,85.8 129.9,86.3 131.4,86.9 133.0,87.5 134.5,88.3 136.1,89.2 137.6,90.2 139.2,91.2 140.7,92.4 142.3,93.7 143.8,95.1 145.4,96.6 146.9,98.2 148.5,99.9 150.0,101.7 151.5,103.6 153.1,105.6 154.6,107.8 156.2,110.0 157.7,112.3 159.3,114.7 160.8,117.2 162.4,119.9 163.9,122.6 165.5,125.4 167.0,128.4 168.6,131.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='168.6,85.0 172.3,86.8 176.0,88.4 179.7,90.0 183.4,91.4 187.1,92.7 190.9,94.0 194.6,95.2 198.3,96.3 202.0,97.3 205.7,98.3 209.4,99.2 213.1,100.1 216.9,100.9 220.6,101.7 224.3,102.4 228.0,103.1 231.7,103.8 235.4,104.4 239.1,105.0 242.9,105.6 246.6,106.2 250.3,106.7 254.0,107.2 257.7,107.7 261.4,108.2 265.1,108.7 268.9,109.1 272.6,109.5 276.3,109.9 280.0,110.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='168.6' cy='85.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='168.6' y='85.0'></text><circle cx='168.6' cy='131.4' r='3.5' fill='white' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='1.5'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 131.4H294.0M122.1 164.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='29.3' y1='128.4' x2='29.3' y2='134.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='26.3' y='145.4' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='75.7' y1='128.4' x2='75.7' y2='134.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='72.7' y='145.4' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='168.6' y1='128.4' x2='168.6' y2='134.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='165.6' y='145.4' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='215.0' y1='128.4' x2='215.0' y2='134.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='145.4' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='261.4' y1='128.4' x2='261.4' y2='134.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='258.4' y='145.4' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='119.1' y1='85.0' x2='125.1' y2='85.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='106.1' y='89.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='119.1' y1='38.6' x2='125.1' y2='38.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='106.1' y='42.6' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}-e^{-x}&\\text{si }x\\lt0\\\\-2x&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\lt1\\\\-\\dfrac2{(x+1)^2}&\\text{si }x\\gt1\\end{cases}\\]<div class='res'>\\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{1\\}\\) y derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\)</div></div>"
    }
