  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-reserva-6-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=x^2-2x+3\\) y \\(g(x)=\\frac12x^2+1\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Esboza las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\), y halla su punto de corte.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de ambas funciones y el eje de ordenadas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es una parábola con vértice \\((1,2)\\) y \\(g\\) una parábola con vértice \\((0,1)\\), las dos hacia arriba. Corte:</p>\\[x^2-2x+3=\\frac{x^2}2+1\\iff\\frac{x^2}2-2x+2=0\\iff x^2-4x+4=0\\iff(x-2)^2=0\\iff x=2\\]<p>Raíz doble: las gráficas son tangentes en \\((2,3)\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='57.1,107.5 60.2,109.9 63.3,112.2 66.4,114.4 69.5,116.5 72.6,118.4 75.7,120.2 78.8,121.9 81.9,123.5 85.0,124.9 88.1,126.2 91.2,127.4 94.3,128.5 97.4,129.4 100.5,130.2 103.6,130.9 106.7,131.5 109.8,131.9 112.9,132.2 116.0,132.4 119.0,132.5 122.1,132.4 125.2,132.2 128.3,131.9 131.4,131.5 134.5,130.9 137.6,130.2 140.7,129.4 143.8,128.5 146.9,127.4 150.0,126.2 153.1,124.9 156.2,123.5 159.3,121.9 162.4,120.3 165.5,118.4 168.6,116.5 171.7,114.4 174.8,112.2 177.9,109.9 181.0,107.5 181.0,107.5 177.9,110.0 174.8,112.4 171.7,114.7 168.6,117.0 165.5,119.2 162.4,121.4 159.3,123.5 156.2,125.5 153.1,127.5 150.0,129.4 146.9,131.2 143.8,133.0 140.7,134.7 137.6,136.4 134.5,138.0 131.4,139.5 128.3,141.0 125.2,142.4 122.1,143.7 119.0,145.0 116.0,146.2 112.9,147.4 109.8,148.5 106.7,149.5 103.6,150.5 100.5,151.4 97.4,152.2 94.3,153.0 91.2,153.7 88.1,154.4 85.0,155.0 81.9,155.5 78.8,156.0 75.7,156.4 72.6,156.7 69.5,157.0 66.4,157.2 63.3,157.4 60.2,157.5 57.1,157.5' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='20.0,68.5 24.3,74.0 28.7,79.2 33.0,84.2 37.3,88.9 41.7,93.4 46.0,97.7 50.3,101.7 54.7,105.5 59.0,109.0 63.3,112.2 67.7,115.3 72.0,118.1 76.3,120.6 80.7,122.9 85.0,124.9 89.3,126.7 93.7,128.3 98.0,129.6 102.3,130.7 106.7,131.5 111.0,132.1 115.3,132.4 119.7,132.5 124.0,132.3 128.3,131.9 132.7,131.3 137.0,130.4 141.3,129.3 145.7,127.9 150.0,126.2 154.3,124.4 158.7,122.3 163.0,119.9 167.3,117.3 171.7,114.4 176.0,111.3 180.3,108.0 184.7,104.4 189.0,100.6 193.3,96.5 197.7,92.2 202.0,87.6 206.3,82.8 210.7,77.7 215.0,72.4 219.3,66.9 223.7,61.1 228.0,55.1 232.3,48.8 236.7,42.2 241.0,35.5 245.3,28.5 249.7,21.2 254.0,13.7 258.3,5.9 262.7,-2.1 267.0,-10.3 271.3,-18.8 275.7,-27.5 280.0,-36.5' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,153.0 24.1,153.9 28.3,154.8 32.4,155.5 36.5,156.1 40.6,156.6 44.8,157.0 48.9,157.3 53.0,157.4 57.1,157.5 61.3,157.4 65.4,157.3 69.5,157.0 73.7,156.6 77.8,156.1 81.9,155.5 86.0,154.8 90.2,153.9 94.3,153.0 98.4,151.9 102.5,150.8 106.7,149.5 110.8,148.1 114.9,146.6 119.0,145.0 123.2,143.3 127.3,141.4 131.4,139.5 135.6,137.4 139.7,135.3 143.8,133.0 147.9,130.6 152.1,128.1 156.2,125.5 160.3,122.8 164.4,119.9 168.6,117.0 172.7,113.9 176.8,110.8 181.0,107.5 185.1,104.1 189.2,100.6 193.3,97.0 197.5,93.3 201.6,89.4 205.7,85.5 209.8,81.4 214.0,77.3 218.1,73.0 222.2,68.6 226.3,64.1 230.5,59.5 234.6,54.8 238.7,49.9 242.9,45.0 247.0,39.9 251.1,34.8 255.2,29.5 259.4,24.1 263.5,18.6 267.6,13.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='181.0' cy='107.5' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='171.0' y='123.5'>(2,3)</text><text x='242.9' y='27.5' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>f</text><text x='258.3' y='67.5' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>g</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 182.5H294.0M57.1 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='119.0' y1='179.5' x2='119.0' y2='185.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='116.0' y='196.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='181.0' y1='179.5' x2='181.0' y2='185.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='178.0' y='196.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='242.9' y1='179.5' x2='242.9' y2='185.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='239.9' y='196.5' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='54.1' y1='157.5' x2='60.1' y2='157.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='41.1' y='161.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='54.1' y1='107.5' x2='60.1' y2='107.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='41.1' y='111.5' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='54.1' y1='57.5' x2='60.1' y2='57.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='41.1' y='61.5' font-size='10'>5</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan (son tangentes) en \\((2,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El recinto está entre \\(x=0\\) (eje de ordenadas) y \\(x=2\\), con \\(f\\) por encima: \\(f-g=\\frac{(x-2)^2}2\\ge0\\).</p>\\[A=\\int_0^2\\frac{(x-2)^2}2\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{(x-2)^3}6\\Bigr]_0^2=0-\\left(-\\frac86\\right)=\\frac43\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac43\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
